{
  "about": "A broker's entry as a provenance source (D-1710, migration 20261123120000). Each case is a stored intake and the state of each required item, as in requiredItems.cases.json; src/data/requiredItems.test.ts reads them as the browser loads them and supabase/tests/broker_intake.sql runs them through public.intake_required_items. A source the browser would drop (a member id that is not a user id, a quote over 200 characters) is dropped by the database too, which leaves the answer with no provenance: the employer's own.",
